      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Job dr_models_failover (action=failover). MANUAL, runs in WEST as ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17). Gates on assess_replication (RPO/readiness); flips dr_state.active_primary = west so WEST becomes the source of truth. No data copy -- the replica is already on WEST.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job dr_models_failover (action=failover). MANUAL, runs in WEST as ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17). Gates on assess_replication (RPO/readiness); flips dr_state.active_primary = west so WEST becomes the source of truth. No data copy -- the replica is already on WEST.",
