      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Job     : dr_models_failover   parameter action=failover\nCadence : MANUAL (declared outage) -- never scheduled\nRuns in : WEST (the promoted primary)   run_as: ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17)\nCommand : databricks bundle run dr_models_failover -t west -- --action failover\nDrill   : dr_models_drill_failover self-asserts the same path (red run = failed).\nNotify  : on_success AND on_failure -> ankita.darekar@databricks.com",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job     : dr_models_failover   parameter action=failover\nCadence : MANUAL (declared outage) -- never scheduled\nRuns in : WEST (the promoted primary)   run_as: ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17)\nCommand : databricks bundle run dr_models_failover -t west -- --action failover\nDrill   : dr_models_drill_failover self-asserts the same path (red run = failed).\nNotify  : on_success AND on_failure -> ankita.darekar@databricks.com",
